# Only what a build writes that is not source for anyone: Vite's and the Worker's output, wrangler's local state,
# charter's own (.charter: the languages' runtime files, scratch), the SDKs before one is published, translators'
# files. Generated Go (*.x.go, *.gen.go) and the agent skills (.claude/skills) are committed: a clone compiles, an
# editor and an agent work in it at once, and a change to what is generated shows in review.
/dist/
/build/
/.wrangler/
/.charter/
/sdk/out/
/xliff/
